# MCP Engine (packages/engine)

## Tech Stack

- **Runtime:** Node.js, ESM modules (`"type": "module"` — use `import`, never `require`)
- **Backend:** Express.js, Winston logging
- **LLM:** Anthropic Claude, OpenAI
- **MCP:** @modelcontextprotocol/sdk
- **Database:** PostgreSQL (source of truth), Redis + BullMQ for queues
- **Frontend:** React 18, Vite, Ant Design, styled-components (port 3050)
- **Deploy:** Docker Compose, PM2

## Key Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `mcp-start.js` | Unified startup — starts all services with health checks and port conflict resolution |
| `start-registry-postgres.js` | Registry API entry point (PostgreSQL mode) |
| `src/llm-gateway/start-llm-gateway-phase4.js` | LLM Gateway entry point |
| `src/delivery-system/delivery-server.js` | WebSocket + REST delivery to EdSteward |
| `src/delivery-system/edsteward-integration.js` | EdSteward API integration logic |
| `config/customers.json` | Target environments (moravian-dev, moravian-prod) with URLs and auth |
| `data/edsteward-regkey-bulk-mapping.json` | REG-key to EdSteward ID mapping (242 entries) |
| `enhanced-regulations/` | Per-regulation JSON files (federal + state) |
| `.env` | Secrets — never commit; copy `.env.example` for setup |

